Pascal Editor on davesgames.io
==============================

This folder hosts a build of Pascal Editor, a 3D building editor.

  Upstream   https://github.com/pascalorg/editor
  Commit     bccd365bbb54d33afd78b67f14579b9fda3a14e1 (tag @pascal-app/editor@1.0.4)
  Licence    MIT, text below. A copy is also in app/LICENSE.txt.

Built from pascalorg/editor bccd365bbb54d33afd78b67f14579b9fda3a14e1,
persistence changed to browser storage.

What davesgames.io changed (all in adapter/, the upstream files are not
edited):
  - Scenes and geometry artifacts are saved in IndexedDB in the browser,
    not in the Next.js scenes API and SQLite store.
  - The navbar has New, Import JSON and Export JSON. There is no project
    list, sign-in, share panel, live sync or thumbnail upload.
  - Only the built-in node plugin (@pascal-app/nodes) loads. The
    third-party plugins of the hosted app are not in this build.
  - next/image, next/link and next/navigation are replaced by small shims.
  - Root paths for icons, sounds and the cursor become relative paths at
    build time, so the build works under a sub-path.
Licences of the npm packages in the bundle: app/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.
To rebuild app/, run build.sh.

